OL,3,AKing Charles arrives in Guyana as
OL,4,ABahamas visit declared 'diplomatic
OL,5,Asuccess'
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles has arrived in Guyana for
OL,8,Fthe second leg of his Caribbean tour,
OL,9,Ffollowing a visit to the Bahamas which
OL,10,FBuckingham Palace described as a
OL,11,F"sensitive balancing act" and
OL,12,F"diplomatic success".
OL,14,FThe main themes of the two-day state
OL,15,Fvisit to Guyana will be the environment
OL,16,Fand sustainability - alongside the
OL,17,Fgrowing commercial ties between the UK
OL,18,Fand Guyana.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
